{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 3, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the bustling market were overwhelming, but the fresh sushi I sampled was well worth it. I also had the opportunity to visit the serene Meiji Shrine, a beautiful Shinto shrine located in a tranquil forested area.\n\nAs I traveled throughout the country, I was struck by the incredible attention to detail that the Japanese are known for. From the immaculately clean streets to the beautifully designed temples and gardens, every aspect of Japanese culture is infused with a sense of respect and care.\n\nOne of the most memorable experiences of my trip was visiting the city of Kyoto, with its stunning temples and traditional Japanese architecture. The city is a treasure trove of history and culture, and I spent hours exploring its many wonders.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with a deep appreciation for the country's rich culture and history. I left feeling inspired and rejuvenated, with memories that I will cherish for a lifetime.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.49703532457351685}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004160914570093155}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25508105754852295}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5825908780097961}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0004291805380489677}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.0003357561945449561}, {"token": ".",